  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tabasco**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Subterranea**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Evidence**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Golden Lady**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2000-04-22.schoeps.ccm4** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 121 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2000-04-22.schoeps.ccm4**: taped by Paul deLima; transferred by Paul deLima; source: Schoeps CCM4 > Grace Design Lunatec V2 > Sony TCD-D8 @ 16bit 48.0kHz [1]. Also: Recorded from the stage lip with Schoeps CCM4 microphones in ORTF, through a Grace Design Lunatec V2 preamp into a Sony TCD-D8 DAT recorder at 16-bit/48kHz; Paul deLima recorded, transferred and uploaded the recording to the LMA [1]",
